Call To Order
Chairman Caughey called the meeting to order at 3:30 p.m. The assembly joined in
the Pledge of Allegiance and were welcomed to the meeting.
Roll Call
Jason Caughey, Jack Stadel, John Watkins,
Natacha Gaspar, Mark Smith
Present
Approval of Minutes
1.
Consideration of the Minutes of the Proceedings for August 22, 2024.

24 - 424
PC 8.22.24 Draft
Attachments:
A motion was made by John Watkins, seconded by Jack Stadel to
approve the Minutes of the Proceedings for August 22, 2024. Vote 5-0.
Caughey, Stadel, Watkins, Gaspar, Smith
Aye:
Land Use:Variances/Board App./Plats
2.
Cheyenne Metropolitan Planning Organization presentation on the
Transportation Improvement Program of project amendments for
Fiscal Year 2024 to 2027.
24 - 432
MPO 2024-27 TIP Amendment 9.12.24
Attachments:
Christopher Yaney, Cheyenne MPO Interim Director, presented the
amendments to the Metropolitan Planning Organization's Transportation
Improvement Program (TIP) for fiscal year 2024 to 2027.  Amendments did
not make any changes to the current plans or add new plans, but is to fix
an oversight by MPO that public review was not properly advertised. The
purpose of this amendment is to bring it to the Laramie County Planning
Commission for a public hearing and to get their approval of the
document.
